{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot one of several <strong>unique Divinoids</strong>, alien mecha that change back and forth between <strong>God </strong>and <strong>Mythical Beast</strong> forms. <strong>Destroy </strong>human armies, <strong>demolish</strong> their cities and <strong>conquer </strong>their planets. Up to <strong>four players co-op</strong>.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through procedurally generated galactic sectors; land on planets to<strong> explore and conquer</strong>.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly <strong>destroyable</strong> everything; climb and destroy buildings, cities and giant bosses piece by piece.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Divinoid is entirely <strong>unique</strong>; no shared moves or even climb mechanics.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shapeshift </strong>between unique God and Mythical Beast forms to handle any situation.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons and passive <strong>modules</strong> for deep customization and replayability.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eject</strong> from your Divinoid when it's destroyed, and keep fighting on foot.</p></li>\t<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a submarine and throw it at a helicopter</strong>!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1251670?t=1774616085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1251670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774616085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1251670/d4acc163c36021297419ce40913456ac4c195575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774616085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1251670/d4acc163c36021297419ce40913456ac4c195575/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774616085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi